---
// Stream windowing playground: a DemoFrame around the StreamWindowDemo React island,
// plus its caption and styles using the `str-` prefix.
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import StreamWindowDemo from '../demos/StreamWindowDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="str-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Event time vs. processing time, windows, and watermarks" titleVi="Thời gian sự kiện hay thời gian xử lý, cửa sổ và watermark">
    <StreamWindowDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Simulated 6-minute stream of 10 baseline events (with a 73-second quiet gap before 10:04:55 so session windows split cleanly) plus an optional offline mobile event stamped 10:00:40 that uploads at 10:05:25. Switch between processing time and event time, change window shapes, and watch how watermark slack trades emission latency against completeness.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mô phỏng luồng 6 phút gồm 10 sự kiện gốc (có khoảng lặng 73 giây trước 10:04:55 để cửa sổ session tách làm hai phiên rõ ràng) cùng một sự kiện di động offline gắn giờ 10:00:40 nhưng tận 10:05:25 mới gửi lên. Thử chuyển giữa thời gian xử lý và thời gian sự kiện, đổi kiểu cửa sổ, và xem độ trễ watermark đánh đổi tốc độ ra số với độ đầy đủ ra sao.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .str-figure {
    margin: 2em 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .str-figure > .demo-frame {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .str-figure > figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .str .sd-group > .str-grp-lbl {
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .str .sd-stat span {
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .str .sd-stat b {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  .str .sd-stat b span {
    font-size: inherit;
    font-weight: inherit;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .str-scrubber {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px 14px;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-alt);
  }
  .str-scrubber-lbl {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-body);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    min-width: 175px;
  }
  .str-scrubber-lbl b {
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .str-range {
    flex: 1 1 180px;
    accent-color: var(--red);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .str-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.45fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .str-body {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  .str-bars-panel,
  .str-log-panel {
    padding: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-alt);
  }
  .str-panel-title {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .str-bars {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 8px;
    height: 156px;
    padding: 8px 4px 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .str-bar-col {
    flex: 1 0 58px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .str-bar-track {
    width: 100%;
    height: 108px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3px;
  }
  .str-bar-count {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .str-bar-fill {
    width: 72%;
    min-height: 3px;
    border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0;
    background: var(--text-muted);
    opacity: 0.72;
    transition: height 0.18s ease;
  }
  .str-bar-col.is-open .str-bar-fill {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1.5px dashed var(--text-muted);
    opacity: 1;
  }
  .str-bar-col.is-bad .str-bar-fill {
    background: var(--red-tint-bg);
    border: 1.6px solid var(--red);
    opacity: 1;
  }
  .str-bar-col.is-bad .str-bar-count {
    color: var(--red);
  }
  .str-bar-col.is-retracted .str-bar-fill {
    background: var(--red);
    opacity: 0.82;
  }
  .str-bar-col.is-retracted .str-bar-count {
    color: var(--red);
  }
  .str-bar-lbl {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--text-body);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .str-bar-state {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .str-bar-col.is-retracted .str-bar-state,
  .str-bar-col.is-bad .str-bar-state {
    color: var(--red);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .str-hint {
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .str-log {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .str-log-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    padding: 5px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .str-log-item.is-retract,
  .str-log-item.is-update,
  .str-log-item.is-drop {
    border-color: var(--red);
    background: var(--red-tint-bg);
  }
  .str-log-ts {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .str-log-msg {
    color: var(--text-body);
  }
  .str-log-item.is-retract .str-log-msg,
  .str-log-item.is-update .str-log-msg,
  .str-log-item.is-drop .str-log-msg {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .str-empty {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }
</style>
